     "body": "<p>From Slack:</p>\n\n<p><a href=\"https://github.com/fcrepo4/fcrepo4/blob/master/fcrepo-auth-common/src/main/java/org/fcrepo/auth/common/ServletContainerAuthFilter.java#L56-L57\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://github.com/fcrepo4/fcrepo4/blob/master/fcrepo-auth-common/src/main/java/org/fcrepo/auth/common/ServletContainerAuthFilter.java#L56-L57</a></p>\n\n<p>which is used to determine what roles a user gets here<br/>\n<a href=\"https://github.com/fcrepo4/fcrepo4/blob/master/fcrepo-auth-common/src/main/java/org/fcrepo/auth/common/ServletContainerAuthFilter.java#L73-L80\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://github.com/fcrepo4/fcrepo4/blob/master/fcrepo-auth-common/src/main/java/org/fcrepo/auth/common/ServletContainerAuthFilter.java#L73-L80</a><br/>\nTo create this token<br/>\n<a href=\"https://github.com/fcrepo4/fcrepo4/blob/master/fcrepo-auth-common/src/main/java/org/fcrepo/auth/common/ServletContainerAuthFilter.java#L81\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://github.com/fcrepo4/fcrepo4/blob/master/fcrepo-auth-common/src/main/java/org/fcrepo/auth/common/ServletContainerAuthFilter.java#L81</a><br/>\nIt would be ideal to just get the currently assigned roles from the User, but from what I have read you need to create your own Principal and add a `getRoles()` function. I don't understand the WebAC and Shiro stuff enough to try that<br/>\nSo for CLAW we assigned an `islandora` role and it is stripped out by that code.<br/>\nWe do add it to the `auth-constraints` in the `web.xml` so I thought maybe we could read it in from there</p>",
     "created": "05/Dec/18 3:31 PM",
